## nano's settings for everyone (nanorc(5)), Beize's: /etc/nanorc links
## here, so updates reach them. To change them for the whole computer,
## replace the link with a file of your own; for yourself, write
## ~/.config/nano/nanorc.

## Syntax highlighting for every language nano knows, as Fedora and Debian
## enable it.
include "/usr/share/nano/*.nanorc"
